  "explanation": {
    "id": "DRAFT-NS117@2025-01-24-explanation",
    "kind": "explanation",
    "text": "Held for Legal. NS117 MUC–DUB was cancelled because NS116 never left Dublin in the storm, so EI-NSL never reached MUC. At STD 14:05Z MUC was calm, and at STA 16:20Z Dublin was 11 kt, after the 02:30–15:00Z window. Whether a knock-on return is extraordinary is a legal question (C-74/19); one question to Legal covers NS113, NS115 and NS117.",
